ities, aimed at attracting foreign direct investment into Qatar. Established in 2019 … We facilitate introductions between investors and government entities … We assist you in setting up your business … Chief Executive Officer, Investment Promotion Agency Qatar","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official page read 2026-10-11."},{"sourceId":"S19","url":"https://www.invest.qa/en/media-centre/news-and-articles/invest-qatar-gateway-introduces-new-feature-connecting-startups-to-venture-capital-funds","description":"Invest Qatar Gateway VC Funding Module 23 June 2026","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"announced the launch of the Venture Capital (VC) Funding Module on the Invest Qatar Gateway, developed in collaboration with Qatar Investment Authority (QIA) … submit their pitches directly to fund managers … many of which are backed by QIA through its $3 billion Fund of Funds programme","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official press release read 2026-10-11 (23 June 2026)."},{"sourceId":"S20","url":"https://www.invest.qa/en/media-centre/news-and-articles/invest-qatar-aurion-capital-and-lg-nova-engage-to-advance-technology-investments","description":"Invest Qatar emerging technologies partnership 23 September 2026","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"a strategic engagement with Aurion Capital, a global investment group, and LG NOVA … artificial intelligence (AI), digital health, financial technologies (FinTech), digital infrastructure, sports, media and entertainment … Qatar offers international investors a gateway to the MENA region and a natural pathway for sustainable regional expansion.","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official press release read 2026-10-11 (23 September 2026)."},{"sourceId":"S21","url":"https://www.invest.qa/en/sectors-and-opportunities/technology","description":"Invest Qatar technology-sector investment opportunities","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"Startup Qatar, an initiative by Invest Qatar, is a single comprehensive resource for information, support, and opportunities offered to startups.","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official sector page read 2026-10-11."},{"sourceId":"S22","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/investqatar/","description":"Invest Qatar official LinkedIn page","publishedAt":null,"evidenceClass":"read 2026-10-11","status":"VERIFIED_AGAINST_SOURCE","excerpt":"Investment Promotion Agency Qatar. Supporting foreign investors to achieve long-term success in Qatar. … Type Government Agency","readAt":"2026-10-11","statusNote":"Official LinkedIn company page read 2026-10-11."}],"quotes":[{"text":"Qatar offers international investors a gateway to the MENA region and a natural pathway for sustainable regional expansion.","sourceId":"S20","speaker":"Sheikh Ali bin Alwaleed Al-Thani, CEO of Invest Qatar","date":null,"use":"SOURCE_QUOTE_ONLY"}],"profile":{"seedVersion":"1.1","verifiedAt":"2026-10-11","oneLine":"Qatar's national investment promotion agency, helping companies enter and grow in Qatar; not a venture fund.","summary":"Invest Qatar is Qatar's Investment Promotion Agency, a government body set up in 2019 to attract foreign direct investment. It does not invest its own money: it provides market information, introductions, partner matching and setup support, and runs the Gateway where startups can reach QIA-backed funds. Its CEO is Sheikh Ali Alwaleed Al-Thani.","rehearsal":[{"topic":"Qatar market-entry readiness","question":"Why should your business establish a base in Qatar?","basisSourceIds":["S18"]},{"topic":"local partnerships","question":"Which local partners and licensing steps do you need?","basisSourceIds":["S18"]},{"topic":"sector alignment and jobs","question":"What measurable benefit would your expansion bring to the local ecosystem?","basisSourceIds":["S20"]},{"topic":"funding